---
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
import { footerColumns } from '../data/nav';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="relative z-10 mt-auto border-t border-brand-900/30 bg-ink text-stone-300">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute -bottom-48 -right-32 h-96 w-96 rounded-full border border-white/[0.05]"></div>
    <div class="absolute -bottom-32 -right-16 h-64 w-64 rounded-full border border-white/[0.05]"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container-xl relative py-12 lg:py-16">
    <div class="grid gap-12 border-b border-white/10 pb-12 md:grid-cols-[1.25fr_2fr]">
      <div>
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3.5">
          <span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-stone-500 font-serif text-lg text-stone-100">山</span>
          <span>
            <span class="block font-serif text-lg font-bold tracking-[0.08em] text-stone-100">VPNs Top</span>
            <span class="text-[9px] tracking-[0.2em] text-stone-500">独立评测 · 清醒选择</span>
          </span>
        </a>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-400">
          专业中文机场与VPN评测平台，独立测速，客观公正。
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-brand-300">
          <span class="h-px w-8 bg-brand-500"></span>
          数据如水，结论有据
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
        {footerColumns.map((column) => (
          <div>
            <h3 class="mb-5 font-serif text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.12em] text-stone-200">{column.title}</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2.5">
              {column.links.map((link) => (
                <li>
                  <a href={link.href} class="text-sm text-stone-400 hover:text-brand-200">{link.label}</a>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 pt-6 text-xs text-stone-500 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between">
      <p>© {year} {SITE.name}. 保留所有权利。</p>
      <p class="max-w-2xl leading-relaxed sm:text-right">
        本站内容仅供技术研究与参考，不构成任何法律建议。请遵守当地法律法规。
        翻墙行为的一切法律责任由使用者自行承担。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
